" + " d: 10E6,
" + " n: -10E6
" + "}
", new DoubleWrapper(10e6).toString()); DoubleWrapper dw5 = Marshallable.fromString(new DoubleWrapper(10e6).toString()); assertEquals(10e6, dw5.d, 0); }

